### Defining a Store

Source: https://github.com/vuejs/pinia/blob/v4/packages/docs/core-concepts/index.md

The `defineStore()` function accepts two distinct values for its second argument: a Setup function or an Options object. The returned function is conventionally named with a `use` prefix and `Store` suffix (e.g., `useUserStore`) to align with composable naming.
